<title>USA: First Alert names Messner as president.</title>
<headline>First Alert names Messner as president.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Ill. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Alert Inc, which makes and markets residential safety products, said Wednesday it named B. Joseph Messner as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Messner succeeds Malcolm Candish who remains chairman.  </p>
<p>Messner, 44, was most recently president of Bushnell Corp, formerly a sports optics division of Bausch &amp; Lomb Inc.</p>
<p>The change is effective immediately.</p>
